---
// The app against a sunrise: the day starting behind your menu bar.
---

<div class="dawn">
  <div class="sun" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <picture>
    <source srcset="/images/dayline-menu-overview.avif" type="image/avif" />
    <img
      src="/images/dayline-menu-overview.webp"
      alt="The Dayline menu showing today’s calendar events, Linear issues and notes"
      width="1030"
      height="1614"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
  </picture>
</div>
<div class="works-with">
  <span>Works with</span>
  <img
    src="/images/google-calendar-wordmark.webp"
    alt="Google Calendar"
    width="3113"
    height="403"
  />
  <img
    src="/images/linear-wordmark.svg"
    alt="Linear"
    width="400"
    height="100"
  />
  <img src="/images/github-wordmark.svg" alt="GitHub" width="416" height="95" />
  <span>and Apple Reminders</span>
</div>
